"A chance encounter brings you across the path of a nomadic family, fellow" 
"travelers who have heard of your quest and offer you a place to rest. Welcomed" 
"into their group, you find comfort in the warmth of their hospitality." 
"****"
"Recognizing your purpose, the husband shares invaluable wisdom, teaching you" 
"the art of combat and defense. Days blend into nights as you spend time" 
"together, sharing stories around the campfire, breaking bread, and building" 
"strong bonds." 
"****"
"As you prepare to leave, they gift you supplies for the road," 
"showing a true spirit of generosity. Gratitude fills your heart as you say" 
"goodbye, and their parting words give you a stronger push to keep going." 
""
*END*
